# ---- data archives and downloads: NEVER commit these -------------------------
# `git add -A` in this directory swept a 4 GB dataset2024.zip into a commit and
# took .git from ~20 MB to 3.9 GB. Third-party datasets are inputs staged by
# scripts/fetch_buu.py, not repo contents -- and BUU is not redistributable here.
*.zip
*.crdownload
*.part
data/BUU-LSPINE/
data/BUU-LSPINE_400/
data/*.nii.gz
data/runs/
results/
runs/
# large PDFs dropped in while reading
*.pdf
